        "TileImage": "$($repository 04099e27-3441-4488-b005-94e651dd4878).Image",
        "Description": "Five hardened criminals once plagued Los Angeles, responsible for armed heists, drug trafficking, and countless ruthless murders. They have now fled to Whittleton Village to hide from their crimes and live out their days in cowardly seclusion. My objective is to locate every single one of these fugitives, neutralize all targets, bring them to final justice, and terminate them on site.",
